sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Author
  participant GW as gateway
  participant K as Kafka
  participant IN as ingestion
  participant DB as Postgres
  A->>GW: POST /knowledge/documents
  GW->>K: key tenant:docId · tenantId from JWT · acks=all
  alt acked within 5 s
    GW-->>A: 202 QUEUED
  else no ack
    GW-->>A: 503 (never silently dropped)
  end
  K->>IN: consume (group sentinel-ingestion)
  IN->>DB: same content hash already indexed?
  alt unchanged
    IN->>IN: skip (no embedding cost)
  else new or changed
    IN->>IN: heading-aware chunks → embed (384-d)
    IN->>DB: one transaction: upsert doc · delete chunks · insert chunks
  end
  Note over IN,K: transient error → backoff ≤ 10 s → DLT · invalid doc → DLT now
